BEGIN_TEXT
The channels this station uses, each by its plan label (a designator).
Every screen names a channel by its label; frequencies are never shown
here and never leave the box.

A channel's label is what a net, a schedule and the tuner go by. When the
radio is set to a channel through the tuner, nets that name that channel
take check-ins from stations heard on it.

Labels come from the channel plan loaded on this box. A channel with no
label is shown by its place in the scan plan, as W1C2 (window 1, channel
2).
END
